height:20px;color:#373435;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\">Do not share this code with anyone. If you did not request it, you can ignore this email.</div></td></tr></table></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px\" bgcolor=\"#F5F4F4\" style=\"padding:22px 32px 26px;background:#F5F4F4;border-top:1px solid #E8E6E7\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#5F5C5D\">You received this because a verification code was requested for this address.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Outfit,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1B1A1A\">National Information Technology Development Agency</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#5F5C5D\">DGO Digital Ops · No. 28, Port Harcourt Crescent, Off Gimbiya Street, Area 11, Garki, Abuja</p><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:17px;color:#5F5C5D\"><a href=\"https://nitda.gov.ng\" style=\"color:#05583B;text-decoration:underline\">nitda.gov.ng</a> · Internal: for NITDA staff only · Automated message</p></td></tr>\n</table>\n<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></table>\n</body></html>",
                        "emailMessage/Importance": "Normal"
                      },
